      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.3.05-07",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Employment can be direct, such as guides, reception staff, cooks, cleaners or drivers serving visitors. Indirect employment can arise among suppliers, maintenance services or producers meeting tourism demand. Jobs provide income and may support skills development. The relevant judgement also considers duration, pay, working conditions and access. Ten temporary positions for one week are not equivalent to ten stable year-round jobs.",
