      "block_type": "plain_explanation",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Training can help workers gain guiding, hospitality, business or language skills. Such skills may improve service quality and support later opportunities. The benefit depends on access to training, suitable content and opportunities to use it. A training attendance record demonstrates participation, not automatically improved earnings. Evidence of skills, employment or enterprise performance helps connect the activity to its intended development outcome.",
